    {"on": "Alkibiades combined their several parties, arranged matters with Nikias, and turned the ostracism against Hyperbolus himself", "text": "The safeguard had become a game. Two powerful men, who should each have feared it, organised their followers to use it on a third. A device meant to protect the people was captured by the very people it was meant to restrain."},
